n下来以前，我们不是不该轻举妄动？\n&费曜\n世英你是新来的，所以不懂大将军的行事\n风格。你要学会变通，这叫临机应变。\n&费曜\n现在蜀人就在眼前，我们不痛宰他就说\n不过去了吧。\n&鲁芝\n我还是觉得有点不妥。\n&费曜\n这次我可是带足兵马，甚至连王子全这位\n无双猛将都带上了，就是让那姜维连一点\n机会也没有。\n&鲁芝\n（费曜副将当太久似乎闷坏了，头次独立\n带兵就显得志得意满。）"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[728,7,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王双\n将军放心。有我王双在，哪怕是姜维，\n就算是赵云或魏延我都吞给你看。\n&魏平\n（这王双也真蠢，这种工作吃力不讨好，\n有功还不都是给费曜。我在一旁看戏就好\n了。）"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&鲁芝\n我们还是应该等大将军或是张郃将军的\n中军到来再行动会比较稳当吧。\n&鲁芝\n不然直接放蜀人回去就好，张郃将军说过\n蜀人的粮草屈指一算撑不到十天。\n&费曜\n我们作属下的就是要积极，怎么可以什么\n事情都要大将军处理呢？\n&费曜\n更何况我可不希望再让张郃那讨人厌的\n家伙得意了。"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[83,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[801,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[85,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[728,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏延\n虽说敌人人数不少，不过这种程度的军队\n就想要进行追击，这个费曜也太天真了。\n&姜维\n现在正是给敌人迎头痛击的好机会，不能\n让贼军就这样回去！\n&宁随\n（我本来以为伯约会用计策对付费曜，没\n想到却不用这样的方法，是对自己的指挥\n能力太有自信？）\n&宁随\n（不，或许是因为魏延在这里，他才想要\n展示常败军的实力也不一定。）\n&魏延\n（常败军的实力如何，就让我亲眼来确认\n一下吧。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1006],[]]},"end":130},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[801,83,65535,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[83,801,65535,0,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&鲁芝\n擅自出动军队这样好吗？在大将军的命令\n下来以前，我们不是不该轻举妄动？\n&费曜\n世英你是新来的，所以不懂大将军的行事\n风格。你要学会变通，这叫临机应变。\n&费曜\n现在蜀人就在眼前，我们不痛宰他就说\n不过去了吧。\n&鲁芝\n我还是觉得有点不妥。\n&费曜\n这次我可是带足兵马，甚至连王子全这位\n无双猛将都带上了，就是让那姜维连一点\n机会也没有。\n&鲁芝\n（费曜副将当太久似乎闷坏了，头次独立\n带兵就显得志得意满。）"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[728,7,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王双\n将军放心。有我王双在，哪怕是姜维，\n就算是赵云或魏延我都吞给你看。\n&魏平\n（这王双也真蠢，这种工作吃力不讨好，\n有功还不都是给费曜。我在一旁看戏就好\n了。）"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&鲁芝\n我们还是应该等大将军或是张郃将军的\n中军到来再行动会比较稳当吧。\n&鲁芝\n不然直接放蜀人回去就好，张郃将军说过\n蜀人的粮草屈指一算撑不到十天。\n&费曜\n我们作属下的就是要积极，怎么可以什么\n事情都要大将军处理呢？\n&费曜\n更何况我可不希望再让张郃那讨人厌的\n家伙得意了。\n&费曜\n一切就照计画由我假受降，然后世英和\n子全率兵埋伏袭击其后，必可将叛将姜维\n一举成擒。\n&鲁芝\n我总觉得还是有些不妥。这么多人马都派\n出去埋伏，那么本寨这边的防备怎么办？\n&费曜\n这里有魏平防守，万无一失的。\n&鲁芝\n（看魏平这副懒散样，他行吗？）"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,801,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,728,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[1,258,9,6,17,7,2]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,306,9,10,11,1,2]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,307,9,10,11,1,2]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,308,9,10,11,1,2]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,309,9,10,11,1,2]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[83,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[85,65535,2,0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&费曜\n来了！众将随我去迎接姜维。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,83,0,13,17,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,322,0,12,15,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,323,0,13,15,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,324,0,14,15,2]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,325,0,15,15,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&费曜\n大魏后将军费曜来迎接姜伯约来归。\n&姜维\n……\n&费曜\n不答话是不是因为被我发现诈降？\n&费曜\n哈哈，出来吧弟兄们！"]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,728,0,9,17,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,306,0,10,16,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,307,0,10,17,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,308,0,10,18,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,309,0,10,19,1]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,801,0,18,17,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,282,0,17,16,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,283,0,17,17,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,284,0,17,18,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,285,0,17,19,3]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,258,0,12,19,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,259,0,13,19,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,260,0,14,19,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,261,0,15,19,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王双\n哈哈哈，你被我们包围了吧！\n&鲁芝\n姜维快快受死吧！\n（总觉得有点不安。）\n&魏平\n前方看起来打得挺激烈的，不过不关\n我的事。继续睡一觉吧…ＺＺＺ\n&姜维\n…"]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,0,0,0,0,0,6]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&费曜\n咦？！怎么消失了？莫非这个姜维\n是假的？"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,0,0,13,6,2]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,2,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,3,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,4,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,5,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏平\n好吵，这样怎么睡？喂！外面的畜牲\n别吵！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[85,3,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏平\n咦？怎么打到我这来了？救命啊！"]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[85,9,1,1]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[2,65535,0,10,6,17,11,2,1,0,8,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[83,65535,0,0,1,1]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[83,3,1,1]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[83,9,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&费曜\n糟糕，营寨被劫了！大家快回去救。"]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,0,11,14,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,0,11,15,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,0,11,16,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,0,16,14,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,0,16,15,0,0]},{"op":88,"name":"op_58","args":[0,0,0,16,16,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[83,9,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&费曜\n呜呜…这下糟了，前面寨门被火挡住根本\n进不去。\n&鲁芝\n旁边寨门没有火还可以进去。\n&鲁芝\n（等一下…这样我军必须绕远路就会\n因为部队机动力不同而被分断，可是也\n没选择了。）"]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[83,65535,0,0,1,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&王双\n真麻烦！弟兄们，从侧边寨门回去救援。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[26,26,"只怕你没机会了。"]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,26,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[728,65535,3,0,1,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏延\n王双，你的死期到了。\n&王双\n笑话，我王子全靠著流星槌，这十几年\n还没碰到过对手。\n&魏延\n那不过是你没有碰过真正的大将，要是\n子龙或叔至在的话，你可能连说大话的\n机会都没有。\n&王双\n哼，那就试试看我是不是在说大话。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&宁随\n伯约果然高招，不过目前敌人数量还是在\n我军之上。\n&宁随\n必须得在费曜回来以前先占据营寨才行。\n&姜维\n的确。我们部队毕竟还是少数，不能强求\n去歼灭敌军，要是情况不对的话，抓住\n费曜攻击就好。\n&柳隐\n只是为什么魏延将军要去负责那么危险的\n工作？明明他的地位已经高到不需要做这\n种事。\n&杨兰\n我们羌人的大将都是要在前面身先士卒\n，不然底下的将士是不会听命于他。\n&杨兰\n因为他必须要用实力来说服底下的人。\n&杨兰\n或许想魏延将军就像是这种大将。\n&宁随\n（文长和子龙不同，文长的作风并非天性\n使然，反而类似吴起的作风，只是一般\n将士并不懂其中道理。）\n&宁随\n（和魏延并肩作战本来是个不错的主意，\n但若是因此牵扯到和威公的斗争，那可就\n得不偿失了。）"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[38]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑击退费曜。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑姜维死亡。\n二﹑回合数超过30。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑击退费曜。"]},{"op":92,"name":"op_5c","args":[83]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["印绶条件\n全灭敌人。"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":17488,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":17490,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,26,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":17575,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[26,728,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[79]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[26,728,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[728,26,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&魏延\n我要借你的脑袋一用。\n&王双\n说大话的家伙，尝尝我流星槌的厉害吧！"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},"end":67},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[26,728,34]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[1,"",0]},{"op":96,"name":"duel_say","args":[0,"",0]},{"op":97,"name":"duel_end","args":[]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"来吧！\n",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"你……",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,4]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"你……怎么不还手？",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"如果只有这种实力的话，你也没什么\n了不起的。",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,10]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"敢瞧不起我！杀！",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,2,1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,3,0]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[0,10]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[0,"这下子知道我厉害了吧。",1]},{"op":99,"name":"duel_say2","args":[1,"不过如此而已。\n",1]},{"op":100,"name":"duel_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[0,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"duel_action2","args":[1,1,0]},{"op":101,"name":"du